Pantry
This is your family's pantry, just a glorified closet with shelves.

The shelves have some crushed walnuts and a can of yellow wax beans on them.

> x shelves
Plain white shelves, completely utilitarian. And very sturdy.

> x walnuts
Looks like this bag of crushed walnuts was the only thing left in the pantry, what with all the supply chain problems. You've already eaten through most of your supplies.

> x beans
Nobody in the house likes yellow wax beans. But this can is so old now it's part of your heritage, like the rest of the house.

> take walnuts
You take the crushed walnuts off the shelves.

